      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some worlds actually do implement a whitelist. The world scripting can read the VRC URL object, it just can't edit or create them at run time.\n\nOne thing that would help with world author is ability for udon to know the instance type, but I believe there is already a feature request for that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
